      "value": "@{5a51cc2bb1d98804adeed8f0|full_name}: Mentioned this in the discord, but it's less a problem about abuse and more to do with the consequences should everyone start using them. A single extra camera might be alright on most machines, but as you start adding more of them, framerates will quickly drop for everyone - which is unacceptable for VR purposes.",
