      "value": "@{5a0220ed7add6132ccf19b36|full_name}: i do agree, but there is ways of fixing this im sure. like limit the range were u can see a camera and so on, so if ur 10 meters away the camera dont render (if its on a character) and so on. I've not experienced a problem so far with it, (mostly cus not alot of people are using it as you said) but removing it just like this could've been handled abit better, they could've tryed making it work (with some sort of SDK script or whatever u said) i dunno",
