      "value": "@{5a3851d3ad0fe67038f893d2|full_name}: As mentioned above, the bigger problem concerns what happens if you get a room full of those avatars. A 12 player limit is about as small as most worlds come and can be handled even by most low end machines. 12 cameras on those avatars would almost certainly lead to a performance hit.",
